*---------------------- OBJECT DATA FIELD

* Measure 0 - count-in taps on the visible lanes so the chart is playable.
#00011:01010101
#00013:00020002
#00015:02000200

* Measure 1 - one run of four eighth-note slots on lane 1 (channel 51 -> 11):
* a single long note from beat 0 to beat 2.
#00151:0101010100000000

* Measure 2 - two runs on lane 3 (channel 53 -> 13) separated by an empty slot.
* Expected result is two long notes, not one spanning the gap.
#00253:0202000002020000

* Measures 3 and 4 - a run that crosses the measure boundary on lane 5
* (channel 55 -> 15). Expected result is one long note that starts in measure 3
* and ends in measure 4.
#00355:0000000000000303
#00455:0303000000000000

* Measure 5 - follow-up taps, verifying the lane is released and immediately
* playable again.
#00511:01010101

